This directory contains only build, launch and benchmark scripts, two small patches and documentation. It downloads and runs
the following third-party works at install time. None of their source or weights is included here.

NInfer
  https://github.com/Neroued/ninfer
  Apache License 2.0, Copyright Neroued and contributors.
  Pinned commit: see NINFER_PIN. Built with patches/ninfer-dn-sched.patch (Apache-2.0).

Qwen3.8-27B-nvfp4-NInfer (weight artifact)
  https://huggingface.co/neroued/Qwen3.8-27B-nvfp4-NInfer
  Apache License 2.0. Derived from:
    Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B (Alibaba Cloud Qwen team), Apache-2.0
    unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4 (Unsloth), Apache-2.0
    z-lab/Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2 (z-lab), included in the artifact

The benchmark trajectories in bench/traj/ were produced by running mini-swe-agent
(https://github.com/SWE-agent/mini-swe-agent, MIT) on SWE-bench Lite tasks
(https://www.swebench.com, MIT) against the model above.
The trajectories quote excerpts of the django, scikit-learn and sympy sources (BSD-3-Clause).
